{"uid":"4fda891c693fb25c","name":"test_malformed_nested_state_in_a_later_checkpoint_falls_back_on_both_surfaces[tool-pending-int]","fullName":"tests.test_hub_real_render_cap_whole_call#test_malformed_nested_state_in_a_later_checkpoint_falls_back_on_both_surfaces","historyId":"2f5101967ab25207ca6896328574c1a8","time":{"start":1791968858990,"stop":1791968859027,"duration":37},"description":"Task cure-01-03 retry (PRD C.1/C.3, D.1, DoD 3-4): the checkpoint-\n    state shape check reaches INSIDE the containers, and applies to every\n    checkpoint, not just the leading one. A LATER checkpoint (here the\n    last, which seeds the unindexed suffix's render) whose nested value\n    cannot hydrate -- `tool_pending = {\"call-id\": 42}` raised\n    `TypeError: 'int' object is not iterable` out of\n    `ui_server.rendered_log_lines` on both surfaces before this retry --\n    makes `render_index.load_index` refuse the index, and both surfaces\n    answer the exact full-render tail ('gamma', from the appended suffix)\n    instead of raising.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task cure-01-03 retry (PRD C.1/C.3, D.1, DoD 3-4): the checkpoint-<br />\nstate shape check reaches INSIDE the containers, and applies to every<br />\ncheckpoint, not just the leading one. A LATER checkpoint (here the<br />\nlast, which seeds the unindexed suffix's render) whose nested value<br />\ncannot hydrate -- <code>tool_pending = {&quot;call-id&quot;: 42}</code> raised<br />\n<code>TypeError: 'int' object is not iterable</code> out of<br />\n<code>ui_server.rendered_log_lines</code> on both surfaces before this retry --<br />\nmakes <code>render_index.load_index</code> refuse the index, and both surfaces<br />\nanswer the exact full-render tail ('gamma', from the appended suffix)<br />\ninstead of raising.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":17919687768